        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Ai zian e, Pou, Nang ta ai zian e Nang ta;",
            "Ai zian e, Gumeipu aRavguangc, Nang ta;",
            "Ai zian e, Pou, Nang ta, mi hei Nang thay e,",
            "Azuh kamv ai zian cho, ataanv {:1 lyan ni.",
            "",
            "2 Ai neihlaa, ai neihlaa, he ch’rynmei ramgai!",
            "Ai {:1 neihlaamei hei kim dat zat lak khe;",
            "Chyngtwan khou {:1 how the atuang khiuhlanv guay,",
            "Jisu lev baanch’ra nunc, zianmei nunc bam e.",
            "",
            "3 He Jisu Gumeipu, Nang khou ai neihlaa,",
            "Aringcting, aringcbamv, azaengthaek Nang e;",
            "Nang zanc, Nang ramzian hei alu gaymei e,",
            "Nang zauzian {:1 ata lu tiisuanlou e.",
            "",
            "4 Thow nai cho Nang kumhmei, he Salem Guangc Dai!",
            "Ata Kamei zian e, ai thuancna suan e,",
            "Ai thuanc ni, ai suan ni, khwan ranvna suan ni,",
            "Neihlaamei duiriang kumc akhou uangc bam ni."
          ]
        }
      },
